{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmxpWWFW1FWx8D7k6w8f","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Ilana:** I didn't decide anything final. If I had to pick one, I'd lean towards Harel, the \"כספי (שקלי)\" track, number 13254. But before I put in a shekel I'm asking you, or going to the bank. I'm not sure about it.\n\nWhy that one: Harel is a big name I know. The line says \"מניות 0%\" and \"מט\"ח 0%\", so no shares and no dollars, and \"שקלי\" sounds like plain shekels. It shows \"4.25%\" for 3 years and \"3.08%\" for 5 years, about what my deposits give. The fee is \"0.57%\" \"מהחיסכון\". That's 0.57% of the savings every year, which my deposit doesn't charge as far as I know. So I'm not sure it gives more than the bank at all.\n\nWhat I looked at, in order:\n- **Screen 1:** All black, with a title \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". There was a row of buttons and \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" was already lit up. There were other buttons too, like \"אג\"ח ממשלתי 3\", and government bonds are what I'd trust. But nothing on these pages showed me those tracks, and I didn't press anything. Then came a big table with Harel first.\n- **Screens 2 to 6:** Harel, then Mor, Analyst and Meitav, row after row. I read the track names on the right, the \"מניות\" and \"מט\"ח\" percentages, and the return numbers. I backed away from the ones that said \"מניות 100%\". Those had the big numbers, like \"24.04%\" for 3 years, which is the kind of thing that fell on me years ago.\n- **Screens 7 to 15:** I didn't read them. By the sixth screen I was tired and my eyes hurt from the black. Clal, Migdal and the others, if they're there, I never reached.\n\nWords and signs I didn't understand:\n- **Words:** \"S&P 500\" (I'd just read the letters out), \"עוקב מדד\", \"מדד אג\"ח\", \"סחיר\", \"גמיש\", \"משולב\", \"אשראי ואג\"ח\", \"מט\"ח\", \"חשיפה\", \"ההפקדות\", \"קופה\", and \"כספי (שקלי)\" itself. I'm guessing that last one means safe.\n- **\"פחות מ־3 שנים\":** It sits where the return should be, and I didn't know if that's good or bad.\n- **Numbers like 8211 and 15288:** I don't know what they mean.\n- **The coloured rings:** I didn't try to read them, and the blue and yellow look alike to me.\n- **\"101% מניות\":** How can it be more than a hundred?\n- **Small things:** The small grey \"?\" marks and the small arrows next to the headings I couldn't read. The grey header lines were hard on the black too.\n\nWhat bothered me:\n- **No owner:** The site is called \"מקור\". I've never heard of it and I can't tell whose it is.\n- **Too many numbers:** Every row has eight, and it made me anxious.\n- **Fees I can't compare:** Nothing tells me what my bank takes, so I can't check whether the bank is taking too much from me."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3749,"cache_read_input_tokens":11648,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3749},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"60f6addf-784d-48fc-a7e1-b4cc94fe8d45","uuid":"f4f9bdff-df16-4e7e-a9be-9182ec3c117f","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:08:16.114Z","request_id":"req_011CgmxpWJ6gyG4hv15ZPWmL"}
